    "backstory": "Born in the radioactive swamps outside Subchain City, 'Bubble' Bass was abandoned at a young age. Raised by a pack of feral cyber-gophers, he learned the art of scavenging and demolition, skills that made him a valuable asset in the cutthroat world of DRIP raids.",
